{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:43.049756+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"This is expected behavior; see https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37766#issuecomment-4482876732.","created_at":"2026-05-18T22:41:02Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765#issuecomment-4482882312","id":4482882312,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABCzNbCA","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4482882312/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-05-18T22:41:02Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4482882312","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nWhen a symmetric matrix has an eigenvalue in the float32 subnormal range, `jnp.linalg.eigvalsh` replaces it with `0.0`. Likewise, `jnp.linalg.det` returns `0.0` when the true determinant is subnormal. NumPy computes both correctly.\n\nI'm working on a problem where I construct covariance matrices that can be very ill-conditioned — some eigenvalues legitimately fall in the subnormal range. JAX incorrectly reports these as zero, which makes the matrix look singular when it isn't.\n\nThe simplest test case is a diagonal matrix, where the eigenvalues are exactly the diagonal entries and the determinant is their product:\n\n```python\nimport numpy as np, jax.numpy as jnp\n\ntiny = np.finfo(np.float32).tiny\nsv   = np.float32(1e-40)   # subnormal\nA    = np.diag(np.array([1.0, 0.01, float(sv)], dtype=np.float32))\n\nprint(np.linalg.eigvalsh(A))   # [1e-40, 0.01, 1.0]   ← correct\nprint(jnp.linalg.eigvalsh(jnp.array(A)))  # [0.   0.01 1.  ]  ← BUG\n\nprint(np.linalg.det(A))            # ~1e-42  ← correct\nprint(jnp.linalg.det(jnp.array(A)))  # 0.0  ← BUG\n```\n\n## All three subnormal test values\n\n```\nsv=1.18e-38:  np eig[0]=1.175e-38   jax eig[0]=0.0   |  np det=1.175e-40   jax det=0.0\nsv=1.00e-40:  np eig[0]=1.000e-40   jax eig[0]=0.0   |  np det=1.001e-42   jax det=0.0\nsv=9.95e-44:  np eig[0]=9.949e-44   jax eig[0]=0.0   |  np det=1.401e-45   jax det=0.0\n```\n\n## Notes\n\n- The larger eigenvalues (1.0 and 0.01) are unaffected — only the subnormal is wrong.\n- Downstream code using `jnp.linalg.matrix_rank` or condition numbers is also impacted: flushing a small-but-nonzero eigenvalue to zero makes a full-rank matrix appear rank-deficient.\n- Likely the same XLA DAZ (Denormals-Are-Zero) issue that affects scalar math ops — the LAPACK kernels called by XLA for eigh and LU decomposition run with the DAZ flag set.\n- `jnp.linalg.svd` has the same problem with subnormal singular values.\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:     0.10.1.dev20260513+64f6e229b\njaxlib:  0.10.0\nnumpy:   2.4.4\nscipy:   1.17.1\npython:  3.12.3\nOS:      Linux-6.14.0-37-generic-x86_64-with-glibc2.39\nbackend: cpu\n```","closed_at":"2026-05-18T22:41:01Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765/comments","created_at":"2026-05-18T20:57:15Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765","id":4472523552,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABCpVLIA","number":37765,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37765/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","s